#, no-wrap
msgid "HOMEPAGE"
msgstr "ДОМАШНЯЯ СТРАНИЦА"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:402
msgid ""
"More information about live-config and the Debian Live project can be found "
"on the homepage at E<lt>I<https://wiki.debian.org/DebianLive>E<gt> and in "
"the manual at E<lt>I<https://live-team.pages.debian.net/live-manual/>E<gt>."
msgstr ""
"Больше информации о live-config и проекте Debian Live можно найти на "
"домашней странице по адресу E<lt>I<https://wiki.debian.org/DebianLive>E<gt> "
"и в руководстве по адресу E<lt>I<https://live-team.pages.debian.net/live-"
"manual/>E<gt>."

#. type: SH
#: en/live-config.7:403
#, no-wrap
msgid "BUGS"
msgstr "ОШИБКИ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:405
msgid ""
"Bugs can be reported by submitting a bugreport for the live-config package "
"in the Bug Tracking System at E<lt>I<http://bugs.debian.org/>E<gt> or by "
"writing a mail to the Debian Live mailing list at E<lt>I<debian-"
"live@lists.debian.org>E<gt>."
msgstr ""
"Об ошибках можно сообщать, отправляя отчет об ошибке для пакета live-config "
"в системе отслеживания ошибок по адресу E<lt>I<http://bugs.debian.org/>E<gt> "
"или написав письмо в список рассылки Debian Live по адресу E<lt>I<debian-"
"live@lists.debian.org>E<gt>."

#. type: SH
#: en/live-config.7:406
#, no-wrap
msgid "AUTHOR"
msgstr "АВТОР"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:407
msgid ""
"live-config was originally written by Daniel Baumann E<lt>I<mail@daniel-"
"baumann.ch>E<gt>. Since 2016 development has been continued by the Debian "
"Live team. Since 2025 development of the modified version has been continued "
"by the MiniOS Live team."
msgstr ""
"Изначально live-config был написан Даниэлем Бауманом E<lt>I<mail@daniel-"
"baumann.ch>E<gt>. С 2016 года разработка продолжается командой Debian Live. "
"С 2025 года разработка модифицированной версии продолжается командой MiniOS "
"Live."
